{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actual","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLTupletV7PortionV","text":"Portion","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/Portion","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to a nested MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"<tuplet-actual>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" element.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLTupletV6actualAC7PortionVSgvp","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"actual","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actual","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLTupletV7PortionV","text":"Portion","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/actual"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltuplet\/actual"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"The tuplet-actual element provide optional full control over how the actual part of the tuplet is displayed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including number and note type (with dots). If any of these elements are absent, their values are based on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"time-modification element.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTuplet/actual":{"title":"actual","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltuplet\/actual","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"actual"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Portion","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLTupletV7PortionV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/actual","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tuplet-actual element provide optional full control over how the actual part of the tuplet is displayed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"including number and note type (with dots). If any of these elements are absent, their values are based on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time-modification element."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTuplet":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltuplet","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTuplet"}],"title":"MXLTuplet","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tuplet element is present when a tuplet is to be displayed graphically, in addition to the sound data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided by the time-modification elements. The number attribute is used to distinguish nested tuplets. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bracket attribute is used to indicate the presence of a bracket. If unspecified, the results are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implementation-dependent. The line-shape attribute is used to specify whether the bracket is straight or in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the older curved or slurred style. It is straight by default."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLTuplet","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTuplet/Portion":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltuplet\/portion","title":"MXLTuplet.Portion","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Portion","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Portion","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tuplet-portion type provides optional full control over tuplet specifications. It allows the number and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"note type (including dots) to be set for the actual and normal portions of a single tuplet. If any of these"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements are absent, their values are based on the time-modification element."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/Portion"}}}